{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PhX49g968PmhHzyqoXEpHE","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# solver-trace-ablation — Research Dashboard\n2\t\n3\t> 最后更新: 2026-05-13 21:58 UTC | 更新原因: MVP 通过，进入 research 阶段，引用 paper_framing + experiment_plan\n4\t\n5\t## 核心方向\n6\tSTA（Solver Trace Ablation）：首次将 mutation testing RIP 框架系统性引入 RL reward design，为 neurosymbolic formalizer 的 GRPO 训练提供 intensional verification reward。详见 paper_framing.md。\n7\t\n8\t## 当前进展\n9\t- **阶段**: Research（MVP 2026-05-13 通过）\n10\t- **基础设施**: westd-39279 × 2 RTX PRO 6000 96GB ✅\n11\t- **MVP 关键发现**: full STA 连续 ISR 检测 reward hacking（ISR/PR 64%→33%）；O(1) fast_isr 无效（阴性结果）\n12\t- **Dream**: dream_20260513T215750 pending（full review mode）\n13\t\n14\t## 实验计划摘要（详见 experiment_plan.yaml）\n15\t- **P0**（~13h GPU）: FOL exec-only vs exec+STA 500步×3seed + held-out eval + O(1) vs O(N) ablation + reward weight ablation\n16\t- **P1**（~8h GPU）: Prolog 单逻辑 + multi-logic + cross-transfer + SFT baseline + hacking annotation\n17\t- **P2**（~9h GPU）: SMT-LIB + Qwen3-8B scaling\n18\t- **总计**: ~30h GPU，wall-clock ~3.5 天（2 GPU 并行）\n19\t\n20\t## 近期任务\n21\t- [ ] 等 Dream 回调，评估 framing/plan 是否需要调整\n22\t- [ ] Dream 通过后启动 P0 实验（plan_001-005）\n23\t- [ ] 并行：Agent 准备 Prolog STA instantiation（为 P1 plan_006 铺路）\n24\t- [ ] 并行：准备 FOLIO/ProofWriter 500条训练 + held-out test split\n25\t\n26\t## GPU 预算\n27\t- 本地: westd-39279 × 2 RTX PRO 6000 96GB（cuda:0, cuda:1）\n28\t- 云: 暂不需要（30h 总量，2卡 ~15h wall-clock）\n29\t\n30\t## 关键决策日志\n31\t\n32\t| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\n33\t|----|------|------|----------|\n34\t| D004 | 2026-05-13 | Reviewer 指出 exec-sta-r5 prove_rate 低于 baseline（退化） | sta-phase1-exec-sta-r5, sta-phase1-exec-only-r5 |\n35\t| D003 | 2026-05-13 | Phase 1 r4 fast_isr_fol 训练信号无效，改用 full STA + K=8 重 | sta-phase1-exec-only-r4, sta-phase1-exec-sta-r4 |\n36\t| D002 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 方案调整：50步→100步 + 趋势判断 + Phase 0 ISR baseline +  | — |\n37\t| D001 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 方案：FOL+Prover9 单逻辑 50-step GRPO pilot 验证 STA r | — |\n38\t\n39\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CSUfuCh8A4HYGkDe1spP6m","session_id":"95bba83c-3324-41a4-98d7-5f3633d40984","uuid":"67fd54b5-ee30-4bf5-a436-e1368ac591ec","timestamp":"2026-05-13T21:59:55.025Z"}
